  "strongest_honest_claim": "Under an algorithmically outcome-blind 50%-trace truncation, leading residual DOCKSTRING modes, renormalized to a unit-diagonal target correlation, show higher continuous experimental-geometry concordance and target-pair AUROC than the complete residual correlation on all four examined kinase panels. Average-precision effects are mixed across panels and are not a general result. Because the hypothesis and cutoff were formulated after prior data inspection, this is a replicated exploratory result that requires a new external panel for confirmation.",
